Mon Oct 26 11:20:19 UTC 2026 - Paolo Stivanin <info@paolostivanin.com>

- Update to 0.13.0 (upstream tag v0.13.0, 2026-10-25):
  * Typography: Hyphenation Settings dialog, Hyphenate Across Column,
    Align to Grid in Paragraph Style Options, custom baseline grid
    Relative To options kept through IDML, Story Optical Margin
    Alignment with a size, Character and Paragraph modes in the
    Control panel.
  * Autoflow fills the pages that follow before adding pages at the
    end; Go Back and Go Forward through viewed pages; Convert to
    Note, Previous/Next Note and Convert Variable to Text commands.
  * EPUB: Split Document export option; PDF export preserves placed
    optional-content visibility and layer choices through IDML and
    native saves.
  * Hardening: PDF post-pass slice panics fixed, linked files read
    under a cap, GREP scans bounded, out-of-range RTF/DOCX/IDML
    values rejected, package temp files owner-writable.
  * Many smaller fixes and UI improvements; see the upstream release
    notes.
  * Re-vendored: no crate changes; vendor-tree licence set unchanged;
    no new system deps.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Fri Oct 23 06:52:49 UTC 2026 - Paolo Stivanin <info@paolostivanin.com>

- Update to 0.12.0 (upstream tag v0.12.0, 2026-10-22):
  * Guides: select ruler guides and set their position; a dragged
    ruler guide snaps to guides, margins, columns and objects; Lock
    Guides and Lock Column Guides are commands.
  * Column guides: drag one to move its gutter; Margins and Columns,
    autoflow, inserted pages and new parents keep dragged columns;
    IDML imports, validates and round-trips them.
  * Keyboard Shortcuts can import an InDesign shortcut set; the
    French interface is complete.
  * Fixes: Paste in Place shortcut, other apps' text pastes into a
    text caret, trailing-space dots before the paragraph mark, Rule
    Above offset measured from the baseline, SVG font families match
    in any case, an explicit Place position makes a new frame.
  * Date handling uses chrono instead of hand-rolled UTC code.
  * 0.11.0: placed PDFs are read through the shared craft-pdf
    reader (bounded input and per-stream decode limits); incomplete
    layered exports are reported.
  * Re-vendored: chrono 0.4.45 (MIT OR Apache-2.0) is the only new
    crate; the patched hayro crates now come from craft-libs and the
    winit pin from storytold/winit (same commit), licences as
    before. Vendor-tree licence set unchanged; no new system deps;
    cargo_audit clean.
- Ship upstream's new licenses/pdf-backend/ texts (hayro, embedded
  Foxit fonts, CMYK profile, Adobe CMaps) that NOTICE refers to.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed Oct 21 06:40:33 UTC 2026 - Paolo Stivanin <info@paolostivanin.com>

- Update to 0.10.0 (upstream tag v0.10.0, 2026-10-20):
  * Tables: cell First Baseline offset; Links panel shows page and
    resolution of anchored images; text stroke options in the Stroke
    panel; New Document preset sizes shown in the selected units.
  * Fixes: single-line paths resizable along their length, drop cap
    scaling, moved equations keep their place, clickable dock
    chevrons, Story Editor label alignment.
  * Import/export hardening: non-finite or out-of-range values in
    IDML, DOCX, RTF, Tagged Text and ASE; PDF/X-4 XMP gains
    MetadataDate and VersionID.
  * Re-vendored; no new system deps.

