Sun Oct 18 17:25:40 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.9.0 (upstream tag v0.9.0, 2026-10-18):
  * Page tool with liquid rules, pins and resize locks; Pages
    panel; Alternate Layout; Table of Contents and IDML TOC
    styles; InDesign-order menus and shortcuts
  * Export: PDF/A-2b leaves out forms and media; EPUB/IDML
    selector and sort-key fixes
  * Harden against crafted input (no CVE assigned): LaTeX
    nesting depth capped; page-insert overflow fixed;
    nonfinite EPS boxes rejected; click/drag input bounded;
    quick-xml 0.41 (RUSTSEC-2026-0194, RUSTSEC-2026-0195)
  * cargo_audit clean.
- Vendor-tree licence set unchanged.

