Thu Oct 15 05:00:41 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.8.0 (stable tag v0.8.0, 2026-10-14, draft=false
  prerelease=false)
- Save/export atomically; per-app recovery kept until save/close;
  quitting asks for unsaved docs; macOS Dock Quit cancelable
- Text: CR as paragraph return, leading empty Tagged Text para kept,
  one underline bar per stretch, gradient midpoints mirrored
- Objects: Arrange past siblings, locked fixed on distribute, corner
  options round every point, Step and Repeat grid with preview
- Import/export: EPUB selectors match tags, IDML sort keys kept, table
  cells split once, preflight checks placed-image resolution
- Engine: NaN-safe path clamping, xref no longer rebuilds itself;
  placed PDFs render via pdfcraft patched hayro crates
- Services: tar_scm pinned tag v0.8.0, vendor regenerated (update=false
  kept for --locked, no in-tree vendor/ upstream; winit pin and hayro
  git patches vendored); docs/brand/ still excluded
- License re-derived over shipped targets: no copyleft linked (hayro
  under Apache-2.0, winit under Apache-2.0, self_cell under Apache-2.0);
  tag unchanged; rust >= 1.95 holds

