Tue Oct 13 07:27:18 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.7.1 (stable tag v0.7.1, 2026-10-12, draft=false
  prerelease=false)
- Shared panel docking with workspace commands preserved (new
  craft-ui git dependency, MIT OR Apache-2.0, vendored)
- Printing via the new craft-print git dependency (MIT OR
  Apache-2.0, vendored): CUPS and Windows PDF printing
- Place keeps PDF pages and SVGs at exact size; image placed into
  a frame leaves Auto-Fit off; assets deduplicated, unused ones
  omitted on save
- Hyphenation via hypher gains Portuguese patterns; words in
  capitals hyphenate like capitalized words
- IDML import matches part names leniently and reports missing
  parts; fills and strokes must name a document swatch
- MCP server never replays a request after a lost reply; duplicate,
  step-and-repeat and copy-moves report the copies ids
- Upstream MSRV is now 1.95: BuildRequires rust >= 1.95
- Services: tar_scm pinned tag v0.7.1, vendor regenerated (update=false
  for --locked build); docs/brand/ trademarks still excluded
- License re-derived over the new vendor tree for the shipped targets:
  no copyleft linked (craft-print/craft-ui taken under MIT, hypher
  under MIT, self_cell under Apache-2.0); tag unchanged

